{"suttaId":"tha-ap475","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[1628,1675],"vripara":"30"},"segments":{"tha-ap475:0.3":"Ukkāsatikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap475:1.1":"“Kosiko nāma bhagavā, cittakūṭe vasī tadā;","tha-ap475:1.3":"Jhāyī jhānarato buddho, vivekābhirato muni.","tha-ap475:2.1":"“Ajjhogāhetvā [ajjhogahetvā (sī. syā. pī.)] himavantaṃ, nārīgaṇapurakkhato;","tha-ap475:2.3":"Addasaṃ kosikaṃ buddhaṃ, puṇṇamāyeva candimaṃ.","tha-ap475:3.1":"“Ukkāsate gahetvāna, parivāresahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap475:3.3":"Sattarattindivaṃ ṭhatvā [buddho (syā. ka.)], aṭṭhamena agacchahaṃ.","tha-ap475:4.1":"“Vuṭṭhitaṃ kosikaṃ buddhaṃ, sayambhuṃ aparājitaṃ;","tha-ap475:4.3":"Pasannacitto vanditvā, ekaṃ bhikkhaṃ adāsahaṃ.","tha-ap475:5.1":"“Tena kammena dvipadinda, lokajeṭṭha narāsabha;","tha-ap475:5.3":"Uppajjiṃ tusite kāye, ekabhikkhāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap475:6.1":"“Divasañceva rattiñca, āloko hoti me sadā;","tha-ap475:6.3":"Samantā yojanasataṃ, obhāsena pharāmahaṃ.","tha-ap475:7.1":"“Pañcapaññāsakappamhi, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap475:7.3":"Cāturanto vijitāvī, jambumaṇḍassa [jambusaṇḍassa (pī.)] issaro.","tha-ap475:8.1":"“Tadā me nagaraṃ āsi, iddhaṃ phītaṃ sunimmitaṃ;","tha-ap475:8.3":"Tiṃsayojanamāyāmaṃ, vitthārena ca vīsati.","tha-ap475:9.1":"“Sobhaṇaṃ nāma nagaraṃ, vissakammena māpitaṃ;","tha-ap475:9.3":"Dasasaddāvivittaṃ taṃ, sammatāḷasamāhitaṃ.","tha-ap475:10.1":"“Na tamhi nagare atthi, vallikaṭṭhañca mattikā;","tha-ap475:10.3":"Sabbasoṇṇamayaṃyeva, jotate niccakālikaṃ.","tha-ap475:11.1":"“Catupākāraparikkhittaṃ, tayo āsuṃ maṇimayā;","tha-ap475:11.3":"Vemajjhe tālapantī ca, vissakammena māpitā.","tha-ap475:12.1":"“Dasasahassapokkharañño, padumuppalachāditā;","tha-ap475:12.3":"Puṇḍarīkehi [puṇḍarīkādi (syā.)] sañchannā, nānāgandhasamīritā.","tha-ap475:13.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ ukkaṃ dhārayiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap475:13.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, ukkadhārassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap475:14.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap475:15.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap475:16.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap475:17.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ukkāsatiko thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap475:18.1":"Ukkāsatikattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
